msgid "The final step belongs to the fold, equals the score total, and bounds every retained step index."
msgstr "最终步骤属于折叠、等于分数总和，并限定所有保留步骤的索引。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ScoreFoldFinalConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
