msgid "Merge output candidate identities are exactly the union of input candidate identities."
msgstr "合并输出候选身份恰好是输入候选身份的并集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryMergeCandidateUnionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
