msgstr "输出恰好保留原始输入损失节点；不重写其原因、约束及接受归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryMergeLossUnionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
