msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceSelectionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A choice execution retains the matching, nonmatching or explicit unknown branch, never treating an absent verdict as false."
msgstr "选择执行保留匹配、不匹配或明确未知分支，绝不将缺失判定视为false。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceSelectionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for query choice selected-branch law with explicit source bindings."
